{"version":1,"content":"<p>已退休多年的原重慶市市長黃奇帆本周官宣被查【相關報道】，四川省成都市人大常委會原黨組書記包惠被開除黨籍。</p><p>中紀委國家監委網站周六（17日）發評論文章稱，不論職務高低、貢獻大小、退休與否，只要搞了腐敗，就沒有任何退路和所謂平安着陸。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-17T06:39:12.537657+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":115,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-17T06:11:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T08:17:33.607688+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-17T06:37:36.047869+00:00","content_hash":"8bb25d48e1b2b1b6f222e07de99f4bd165da12c352983513e539b800a7321a2b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}